<title>USA: Chicago Miniature to buy back 400,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Chicago Miniature to buy back 400,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Miniature Lamp Inc said it will buy back up to 400,000 shares of its common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>The company did not say over what period it would buy back the shares, which closed Wednesday at 20-1/8. Officials from the company were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>The company has about 19.5 million common shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
